| Version      | Changes                                                                                                          |
| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `v15.0.0-RC` | `params` and `searchParams` are now promises. A [codemod](/docs/app/guides/upgrading/codemods#150) is available. |
| `v13.0.0`    | `page` introduced.                                                                                               |

